#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:43
msgid "ht://dig"
msgstr "ht://dig"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:50
msgid "The fulltext search feature makes use of the ht://dig HTML search engine. You can get ht://dig at the"
msgstr "Bar HTML-biremnär buyınça ezläwne açıp ht://dig digän ısul qullanıp bulaçaq. Anı bonda tabıp bula: "

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:56
msgid "Information about where to get the ht://dig package."
msgstr "ht://dig tuplamasın qayda alıp bulu turında belderä."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:60
msgid "ht://dig home page"
msgstr "ht://dig ana bite"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:66
msgid "Program Locations"
msgstr "YazılımUrnaşıluı"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:73
msgid "ht&dig"
msgstr "ht&dig"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:78
msgid "Enter the path to your htdig program here, e.g. /usr/local/bin/htdig"
msgstr "htdig digän yazılımğa taba yul kertü, ü.ö. /usr/local/bin/htdig"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:83
msgid "ht&search"
msgstr "ht&search"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:88
msgid "Enter the path to your htsearch program here, e.g. /usr/local/bin/htsearch"
msgstr "htsearch digän yazılımğa taba yul kertü, ü.ö. /usr/local/bin/htsearch"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:93
msgid "ht&merge"
msgstr "ht&merge"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:98
msgid "Enter the path to your htmerge program here, e.g. /usr/local/bin/htmerge"
msgstr "htmerge digän yazılımğa taba yul kertü, ü.ö. /usr/local/bin/htmerge"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:104
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "Ara"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:106
msgid "Here you can select which parts of the documentation should be included in the fulltext search index. Available options are the KDE Help pages, the installed man pages, and the installed info pages. You can select any number of these."
msgstr "Qullanmanıñ qaysı bülekläre buyınça töptezmä yasísın bonda saylap bula. KDE'neñ Yärdäm bitlären dä, quyılğan beleşmä (man) bitlären dä saylap bula."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:111
msgid "&KDE help"
msgstr "&KDE yärdäme"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:115
msgid "&Man pages"
msgstr "&Qullanmalar"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:120
msgid "&Info pages"
msgstr "&Açıqlama bitläre"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:125
msgid "Additional Search Paths"
msgstr "Ezläw öçen Östämä Yullar"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:127
msgid "Here you can add additional paths to search for documentation. To add a path, click on the <em>Add...</em> button and select the folder from where additional documentation should be searched. You can remove folders by clicking on the <em>Delete</em> button."
msgstr "Qullanma ezläw öçen östämä yullar bonda kertep bula. Bonı öçen <em>Östäw...</em> töymäsenä çirtep, şul yullarnı saylísı. Törgäklärne taşlaw öçen <em>Taşla</em> töymäse qullanıla."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:132
msgid "Add..."
msgstr "Östäw..."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:142
msgid "Language Settings"
msgstr "Tel Caylaw"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:144
msgid "Here you can select the language you want to create the index for."
msgstr "Yasılaçaq töptezmä telen bonda köyläp bula."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:146
msgid "&Language"
msgstr "&Tel"

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:158
msgid "Generate Index..."
msgstr "İsemlek Ürçetü..."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:159
msgid "Click this button to generate the index for the fulltext search."
msgstr "Böten eçendä ezläw öçen töp tezmä ürçetäse kilsä bu töymägä çirtäse."

#: kcmhtmlsearch.cpp:203
msgid "<h1>Help Index</h1> This configuration module lets you configure the ht://dig engine which can be used for fulltext search in the KDE documentation as well as other system documentation like man and info pages."
msgstr "<h1>Yärdämneñ Töptezmäse</h1> KDE belän sistem qullanmaları bitlärendä tulı ezläw öçen qorılğan ht://dig yazılımın bu modul aşa caylap bula."

